 Internet, what happens in Pakistan happens also in Bradford. Arabs radicalised in Hamburg crash a plane in New York. Anger in Morocco becomes mayhem in Madrid. This book will take a fresh approach, and it will be created by an unusual, even unique method. Rather than concentrating, more or less hysterically, on one or more apsects of the problem (Terrorism Islam Immigration ) it will calmly suggest the things on which most reasonable people can agree. These universal principles will then be offered for debate.","thumbnailUrl":"/book-covers/book-free-speech-ten-principles-for-a-connected-world-timothy-garton-ash.jpg","readerProfile":{"readerLevel":"crossover","narrativeScore":0,"accessibilityScore":0,"scholarlyScore":0.356,"traits":[{"id":"academic","score":0.38,"confidence":"low","evidence":["academic press signal: Yale University Press / Yale University Press"]},{"id":"scholarly","score":0.28,"confidence":"low","evidence":["academic press signal: Yale University Press / Yale University Press"]}],"method":"deterministic_catalog_heuristics_v1"},"experimentalSemanticProfile":{"centralFigures":[],"centralPlaces":[],"argument":{"present":false,"statement":"","confidence":0},"academicOrientation":{"score":55,"confidence":0.46},"profileConfidence":0.46,"model":"gpt-5.4-nano-2026-03-17","promptVersion":8,"inputHash":"21dc1e217dee7c8980f63596b3d6a2c4905a1f4e4cd0837b1702f4fb0d65dffc","reviewStatus":"unreviewed","validationWarnings":[]},"primarySubject":"Politics & Government","secondarySubjects":["Society & Culture"],"confidence":"high","rationale":"The book examines the intersection of liberty and diversity within free societies, making its primary focus politics and governance, while also addressing societal issues.","method":"llm","model":"gpt-4o-mini","reviewStatus":"generated","inputHash":"41fdf0ea49531519fee7860ae0852c5eee72b63e8de73231f8defad5335e4976","displaySummary":"This book will take a fresh approach, and it will be created by an unusual, even unique method. Ra